{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3040, "text": "Hey, Margaret, hot story?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 5900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4300, "text": "Mm -hmm. Oh, the Meredith trial?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 8260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6260, "text": "Mm -hmm. Did they reach a verdict yet?\nMm -hmm."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 9819, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8880, "text": "Innocent or guilty?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 10559, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9820, "text": "Mm -hmm."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 12100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10560, "text": "I can part my hair with my tongue."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 13320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12320, "text": "Mm -hmm."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 23720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22720, "text": "Nice talking to you."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 28760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26520, "text": "Harry, I warmed her up for you."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 30660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29660, "text": "Mm -hmm."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 33490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32470, "text": "Hey. Hey."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 35350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33870, "text": "Hot story? Hot judge."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 41590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39630, "text": "Jack, if you could see this, you\nwouldn't believe it."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 46090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42390, "text": "Margaret turns her nose up at\nChateaubriand and then sinks her teeth"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 47090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46090, "text": "jerky."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 52230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49030, "text": "Why is she pretending she isn't\ncaptivated by me?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 54010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52750, "text": "Maybe she's not pretending."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 57090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54690, "text": "Maybe she knows a real snake when she\nsees one."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 60450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57990, "text": "Snake? Me? Come on. Oh, pose."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 62020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61020, "text": "Drop it, building."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 65820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63820, "text": "Hey, Jack, he was Canadian."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 69080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67520, "text": "Hey, everybody, here's something."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 75880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71060, "text": "Archaeologists have uncovered the sacred\nshrine of the Himalphrodites, an"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 80820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75880, "text": "ancient religion that practiced animal\nsacrifice, polygamy, and plate spinning."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 83640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81780, "text": "Bet they threw some killer parties."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 89540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85000, "text": "Expensive ones. Among the ruins was a 50\n-foot gold statue of their god."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 92400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90640, "text": "Hemophobe, picture page eight."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 101980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98720, "text": "Hey, Bull, turn your head to the left."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 104240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103240, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 111660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110420, "text": "I don't believe it."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 113140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111980, "text": "Will you look at that?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 114660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113660, "text": "Uh -oh."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 116960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114680, "text": "Do I have another wax nugget in my ear\ncanal?"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 129910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128910, "text": "they became extinct."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 134830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131190, "text": "Actually, according to the story,\nthere's still two sects of"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 139190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134830, "text": "in the world. One lives in the ancient\nholy land of Himalphodonia."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 198190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 196590, "text": "See you later, magic man."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 206470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 205230, "text": "Nice -looking woman, huh?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 211270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208450, "text": "Um, yeah, if you go for icebergs and\npower suits."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 216710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213410, "text": "Well, it looks like old Harry's thought\nher out."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 218930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217570, "text": "Only because I made it possible."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 224150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220690, "text": "Well, look, I taught him how to dress,\nhow to walk, how to talk."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 226310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225310, "text": "I created him."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 229690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228350, "text": "Then I gave him a bride."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 233850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231790, "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa. Wait a minute, Dr."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 235090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234090, "text": "Frankenstein."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 239590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235330, "text": "Are you saying that Margaret is a gift\nfrom you to Harry? Yes."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 242010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239870, "text": "Or if we weren't friends, I would have\ntaken it for myself."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 245150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243070, "text": "I could now if I were so inclined."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 249070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247430, "text": "Are you so inclined?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 252410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249930, "text": "No. Of course not. What kind of friend\ndo you think I am?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 256880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 253520, "text": "The kind who would seduce all four\nbridesmaids at his friend's wedding."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 259620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257600, "text": "Only three were bridesmaids."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 262960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261260, "text": "The other one was the bride's mother."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 267560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266160, "text": "Behold, my children."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 269620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268360, "text": "Hemophore has returned."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 274540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272680, "text": "Looks like your flock is growing."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 278820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276200, "text": "I don't get it. What do they want from\nme?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 280560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279380, "text": "Probably the usual."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 284940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281120, "text": "World peace, eternal happiness, the\nanswers to all the mysteries of life."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 288040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285640, "text": "I can't even figure out how my water\npick works."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 295480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293340, "text": "You wanted to see me, boss?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 299280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295700, "text": "Yeah, Phil, listen. I've got some\nundercover work for you. You want me to"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 300920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299280, "text": "some high -level espionage?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 304660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301420, "text": "No, I want you to sniff around Harry's\ngirlfriend's garbage and see what you"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 305439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304660, "text": "dig up."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 308060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305440, "text": "Thanks, boss. That's more up my alley."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 311570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310570, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 315110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313010, "text": "Criminal court part two is now in\nsession."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 317890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315470, "text": "The Honorable Harold T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 319610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318610, "text": "Amen."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 329250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 322530, "text": "What the hell"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 330250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329250, "text": "was that?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 336770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331670, "text": "Amen, sir. It's a word you hear just\nafter deliver us from evil and just"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 338050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336770, "text": "past the Brussels sprouts."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 340690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339690, "text": "I know that."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 342430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341050, "text": "What's it doing in my courtroom?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 344750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342710, "text": "And who are these cone people?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 350990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346490, "text": "Allow me to explain, sir. Because of\nsome pictures in a tabloid, these idiots"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 354290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350990, "text": "think the Tower of Stubble is God."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 357550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356550, "text": "Blasphemer!"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 359470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358250, "text": "Bye, infidel!"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 363430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360450, "text": "Back it up, or you'll be taking a\npilgrimage down the strip, sir."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 392420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388220, "text": "horizons with some popular magazines of\nthe day. We talking real money this"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 394800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392420, "text": "time, Fielding? No tokens, slugs, or\nbuttons?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 398400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396280, "text": "Cash on the barrelhead, my sightless\nfriend?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 402900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401600, "text": "So many choices."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 405100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403120, "text": "Say, what did the lady just buy?"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 406720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405720, "text": "Well, let me see."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 412920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409360, "text": "Uh, she took one of these and one of\nthese."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 416480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413200, "text": "Great, thanks. Here, five bucks. Keep\nthe change. What change? It's $6 .50."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 419800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 418800, "text": "Hey, Jack."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 422100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420620, "text": "What was that all about?"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 425520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423140, "text": "Fielding wanted the same magazines that\nMiss Turner bought."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 429140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426220, "text": "So I sold them a Guns and Ammo and a\nSoldier of Fortune."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 433760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432280, "text": "Margaret reads those things?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 436460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434140, "text": "No. I over -ordered. I had to get rid of\nthem somehow."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 447780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444840, "text": "I can't get away from these people.\nThey're driving me crazy."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 451460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448460, "text": "Oh, you've got to confront them. Be\nhonest. Tell them you're not who they"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 452359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451460, "text": "you are."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 453380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452360, "text": "I think it doesn't work."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 455660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453920, "text": "I've got a bazooka in my locker."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 465160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463480, "text": "Look, I'm just an ordinary man."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 469300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465960, "text": "I can't perform miracles. I can't part\nthe Red Sea."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 471120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469660, "text": "I can't cure the blind."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 475080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474080, "text": "Watch this."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 478180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477000, "text": "How many fingers, Jack?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 479920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478920, "text": "I don't know, four."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 481440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480440, "text": "Hallelujah!"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 485640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485120, "text": "Mission"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 495940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485640, "text": "accomplished,"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 497160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496160, "text": "boss."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 500200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497320, "text": "You idiot, I said root through her\ngarbage, not bring it here."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 502700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500800, "text": "I guess I'm an overachiever."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 509620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508620, "text": "L 'air du temps."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 512320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510620, "text": "Ah, très chic. What else?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 517620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515820, "text": "Sunset Pines Retirement Home."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 521900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518320, "text": "She must be a scout for the obituary\npage. No, I checked it out."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 524159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522159, "text": "She does volunteer work there."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 525920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524580, "text": "Loves the old folks."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 528660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526880, "text": "This is good, Phil. Is that it?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 533200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529000, "text": "Nope. Oh, wait till you get a load of\nthis, boss. I peeled this off a car."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 535640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533820, "text": "Eye cleavage opera."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 542360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541000, "text": "I didn't know you loved opera, boy."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 545660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544660, "text": "I do now."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 547400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546320, "text": "Oh, Phil."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 549860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548420, "text": "This is my opening."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 554260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550680, "text": "The woman wants me. She just doesn't\nknow it yet. Oh, bosh. You're not going"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 555720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554260, "text": "try to steal the judge's girlfriend."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 557180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556180, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 561740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557420, "text": "I'm just going to take her to the brink\nof submission and drop her."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 566000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562580, "text": "Probably with some tender speech about\nthe cruelty of fate and how I'm always"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 568180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566000, "text": "destined to remain just out of her\nreach."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 570100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568820, "text": "Margaret doesn't stand a chance."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 572130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570910, "text": "Putty in my hands."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 575010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573530, "text": "Brown bagging it today, Dan?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 577210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576170, "text": "Hi, Mac, yes."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 584210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581350, "text": "You idiot. I ordered extra crispy."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 593010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592010, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 594770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593770, "text": "Sir?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 598950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 596170, "text": "A little word to the wise about a\nweasel."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 600510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599510, "text": "Say what?"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 604310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601030, "text": "Dan is jealous of your relationship with\nMargaret."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 606130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604830, "text": "No. Yeah."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 609150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 607170, "text": "Dan Fielding is jealous of me?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 610410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609410, "text": "Uh -huh."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 616970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612710, "text": "What are you doing, sir?"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 618190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617190, "text": "I'm basking."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 624810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619870, "text": "Well, I hope this isn't a long bask\nbecause Dan is out to get Margaret, or"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 626150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624810, "text": "least to prove that he can."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 630390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627150, "text": "Oh, come on, Mac. You have any evidence\nof that? Well, he's been following her"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 633330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630390, "text": "around. And I think he had Phil go\nthrough her garbage."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 636110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633890, "text": "Phil goes through everyone's garbage."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 638370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637270, "text": "It's his calling."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 643530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639470, "text": "Okay, but don't say I didn't warn you.\nNow, Dan Fielding is low, but he's not"}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 644369, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643530, "text": "that low."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 645370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644370, "text": "Of course."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 647470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 646070, "text": "Oh, Harry, great news."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 649450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647990, "text": "Dan's taking us to the opera."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 676470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672970, "text": "I can't believe how far Dan has taken\nthis charade. I mean, this box must have"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 677470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 676470, "text": "cost him a fortune."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 680990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677690, "text": "Well, now, are you sure it's what you\nthink it is, Harry? I mean, maybe Dan's"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 682090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680990, "text": "just being benevolent."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 684590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683590, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 688250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686050, "text": "I wonder what's keeping the little road\napple."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 693870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689910, "text": "His date is probably trying to decide\nwhat color tube top is right for the"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 694870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693870, "text": "occasion."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 699330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696590, "text": "Now, how's he gonna seduce me if he's\ngot a date with him?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 701570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700570, "text": "Good evening."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 703580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701840, "text": "Just a few more steps, dear."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 706140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704680, "text": "You're an angel, Stan."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 708300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707300, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 712980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709860, "text": "Harry, Margaret, I'd like you to meet my\ngood friend, Matilda."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 714220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713220, "text": "Hello, Matilda."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 717020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714400, "text": "Hi. Gee, Dan, you never mentioned\nMatilda before."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 719380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717600, "text": "Well, Harry, there's a lot about me you\ndon't know."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 722360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720160, "text": "For instance, you know how I spend my\nSunday mornings?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 725520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723580, "text": "Buffing the scratch marks out of your\nceiling?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 730140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728760, "text": "What a crude remark, Harry."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 731890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730890, "text": "Tell him, Matilda."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 738910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733410, "text": "Every Sunday, this beautiful boy picks\nme up at the rest home and takes me out"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 740210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738910, "text": "for a lovely brunch."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 742350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741350, "text": "How sweet."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 745170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742930, "text": "I do volunteer work at rest homes, too."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 746430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745430, "text": "You do?"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 748250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746690, "text": "Oh, what a coincidence."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 751570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749270, "text": "Can we sit down already?"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 753590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751830, "text": "My corns are killing me. Well, then sit."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 766690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765550, "text": "I wonder what she's saying."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 769630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767830, "text": "Harry, you opera virgin, you."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 778370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772550, "text": "This is the moment where the courtesan,\nVioletta, wonders if she's found her"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 785010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778370, "text": "true love in Alfredo, the handsome\nstranger who's been admiring her from"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 791550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787490, "text": "Perhaps it is he."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 794750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793230, "text": "Van Fielding, I'm impressed."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 798830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797210, "text": "So where's my 50 bucks?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 800430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799290, "text": "You know, 20."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 801950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800850, "text": "Now it's 50."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 807810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803070, "text": "Unless you want your friends to know how\nyou almost broke my hip dragging me out"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 808890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807810, "text": "of the bingo parlor."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 811390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810330, "text": "Fine, fine, here."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 814150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811610, "text": "How about you're away, you geriatric\ncarpetbagger?"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 817710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815710, "text": "Phone call for Judge Stein!"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 820430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818730, "text": "That's Stone, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 823540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822540, "text": "That's fine."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 829280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825020, "text": "Stone. Don't call her Judge Stone.\nSounds important, Harry."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 830900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829900, "text": "Starting."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 835000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831300, "text": "Gee, I wonder who would be calling me\nhere."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 843840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842320, "text": "Dan, what are you doing?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 847940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844180, "text": "I just believe a beautiful woman\nshouldn't be left alone under any"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 850100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847940, "text": "circumstances. What about Matilda?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 852060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850680, "text": "She's napping. No, I'm not."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 853400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852400, "text": "Go to sleep."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 861540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857680, "text": "Isn't Maria Coppamaggio wonderful?"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 862739, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861960, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 863740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862740, "text": "What range."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 870180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864240, "text": "Oh, and just to think that she started\nher career at the tender age of 15."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 876900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 872400, "text": "In La Boheme, playing the role of\ncontinued on page 30."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 878580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877260, "text": "Whoa, she's good."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 891520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885680, "text": "Keeping my seat warm for me? Harry,\nwhere were you supposed... There was a"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 892620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891520, "text": "spider in my seat."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 895720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894500, "text": "What luck, it's gone."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 901100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900100, "text": "So who called?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 905440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901340, "text": "Well, it was the strangest thing. This\nguy launched into this tirade of legal"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 909480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905440, "text": "mumbo -jumbo, and then I guess he got\nflustered because he asked if I had"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 912320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 909480, "text": "Albert in a can, and then he hung up."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 914880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913820, "text": "Stupid Phil."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 921080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917040, "text": "Do I miss much? Oh, some wonderful\nsinging and some lousy acting."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 927660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926660, "text": "Dan,"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 930120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929120, "text": "are you okay?"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 933000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930380, "text": "Something in my throat. Maybe it's that\nspider."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 962200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961200, "text": "hunting scent."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 966960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963020, "text": "Ledger talk, isn't it? All right,\nwhere's the train seal that's been doing"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 970080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966960, "text": "that barking? Down there, with a drool\non his chin."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 974020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973020, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 975660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974120, "text": "And the mezzanine thanks you."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 978220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977700, "text": "Did"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 988920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978220, "text": "you"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 994940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988920, "text": "know that La Traviata was first\nperformed on March"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 997400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994940, "text": "6th, 1853."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1000940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998080, "text": "Dan, your knowledge of opera is uncanny."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1003080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002080, "text": "Opera's my life."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1006020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005020, "text": "Okay, Dan."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1008940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006240, "text": "Oh, um, thanks."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1010240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1009240, "text": "Thanks, Harry."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1016320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014020, "text": "So far, I wonder what's next."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1020490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019050, "text": "What's that, Matilda, you can't see?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1021890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020810, "text": "I can see fine."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1031270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026589, "text": "Except for those blurry objects on the\nstage. Oh, dear, dear, dear. I bet you"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1034770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1031270, "text": "could use a pair of those rented opera\nglasses, huh? Harry, would you mind"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1037869, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034770, "text": "renting... Here, Dan, way ahead of you.\nBorrow ours. Oh, uh, thanks."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1039609, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038190, "text": "Oops! Ow!"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1041970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040970, "text": "Shhh!"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1043790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1042490, "text": "Clumsy, clumsy me."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1053820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052560, "text": "Should have worn my sneakers."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1063220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058980, "text": "But I've dropped in just one more time.\nDan, you don't have to explain."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1065460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064420, "text": "I know what you want."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1067419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066440, "text": "You do?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1071840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067420, "text": "Yes, and I'm thrilled because although\nI've never said it, I want you to."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1073500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072500, "text": "You do?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1075760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073620, "text": "Yes, more than you could possibly know."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1080460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076100, "text": "Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes. I knew it. I\nknew you wanted me. Oh, Dan, I do."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1082060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080880, "text": "Oh, and I, you, Margaret."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1086740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082820, "text": "But alas, fate has dealt us a painful\nhand."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1093180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087420, "text": "You're committed to Harry, and I shall\nalways remain a fantasy forever, just"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1094180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093180, "text": "of your reach."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1095500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094500, "text": "Not necessarily."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1098179, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1097220, "text": "Wait, what?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1101580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098180, "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa, what about Harry? Oh,\nhe means nothing to me."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1106420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102000, "text": "I've only let him on, pining for you.\nOh, Dan, how I've agonized."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1111140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108400, "text": "Wait, no, no. I'm sure it wasn't me,\nMark. It could have been anything. Bad"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1115200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111140, "text": "scallops. No, no, no. It's you, Dan. I\nneed you."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1116580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115500, "text": "I want you."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1118100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117020, "text": "Dare I say it?"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1119780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118680, "text": "I love you."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1125380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123360, "text": "What the hell is going on here?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1131640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127520, "text": "My best girl."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1134440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133280, "text": "My best friend."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1137920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136100, "text": "And my favorite little old lady."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1145110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144110, "text": "here for the money."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1150370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146230, "text": "Harry, now, this isn't what it seems.\nNo, he's right, Harry. It's much more"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1152730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150370, "text": "that. Dan and I are madly in love."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1156530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155530, "text": "We are not."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1164870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161050, "text": "My whole life is falling apart in front\nof me. No, wait, no, no, Harry, come on."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1167490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164970, "text": "You're getting a little carried away.\nLet's sit down and talk this over like"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1168490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167490, "text": "friends."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1171010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169670, "text": "Friends without knives!"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1173449, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172570, "text": "Don't shoot!"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1174590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173450, "text": "He's got a knife."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1176710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175410, "text": "This is where I get off."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1178050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177050, "text": "Put my purse."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1181730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178390, "text": "Harry, put the knife down."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1183110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182110, "text": "Don't kill him, Harry."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1185150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183270, "text": "I'm the she -devil. Take me."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1187250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185630, "text": "She's right. It's all her fault."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1190430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189070, "text": "She's a vixen."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1193590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191950, "text": "And you love her."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1195090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193790, "text": "But don't be ridiculous."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1197050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196050, "text": "We're friends."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1202710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197710, "text": "I never meant for it to go this far. I\nwas just toying with her."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1204890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203230, "text": "Just to see if I still had the touch."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1209010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206470, "text": "I wish I could believe that. You can."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1211010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209550, "text": "Try. Try."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1213990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1212990, "text": "No, Dan."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1216670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214810, "text": "There's a pain deep in my heart."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1218610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217290, "text": "And there's only one way."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1250900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249900, "text": "And for what?"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1255000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251220, "text": "Just to prove that my days as a lady\nkiller aren't over."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1257280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256020, "text": "Ah, but they are."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1260480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258820, "text": "Now I'm a judge killer."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1264520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261680, "text": "And your blood shall forever stain my\nsoul."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1269400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264980, "text": "And I shall be exposed to the world for\nwhat I really am."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1273160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271740, "text": "What might that be?"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1284440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283440, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1287540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286220, "text": "Pitiful fool."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1290940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289940, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1297440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291540, "text": "Now that you've said that, I can die a\nhappy man."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1302300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1299940, "text": "In, say, maybe 40 years."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1346700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343920, "text": "those fanatics would never leave. Now I\ncan finally go home."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1356800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353200, "text": "Sorry, big guy. The great one has\nfinally emerged from his meditation."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1359140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1357340, "text": "Speak to us, oh hemophone."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1363360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361500, "text": "You seem like such nice folks."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1365040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1363880, "text": "Let me level with you."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1368720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1365520, "text": "If you're looking for a god, you're\nlooking in the wrong place."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1375540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374540, "text": "Sorry."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1379260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375920, "text": "Just as we were going to offer you a\ngift of your weight in gold."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1384640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1379980, "text": "Did he say my weight in gold?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1386180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1385120, "text": "He sure did."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1387420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1386420, "text": "Hey, wait a minute!"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1390800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1389060, "text": "Wait a minute. Did you say God?"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1392880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1391260, "text": "I'm sorry. I thought you said guard."}
